  "notes": "﻿## What's Fixed in VaalAuras v1.0.3\n\n- **Fixed overlay startup crash on both CUDA and DirectML**: Resolved a native compilation bug in the HUD resource reader (\u0000xC0000005 access violation) and disabled Cython runtime annotation enforcement so compiled .pyd/.so builds match Python runtime behavior cleanly.\n- **Fixed off-thread UI calls**: Moved update checker, update download/planning dialog, and skill-calibration save callbacks onto main-thread Tk queues to prevent background-thread Tk crashes.\n- **Added crash diagnostics**: Native faults and unhandled exceptions now persist to \u0007pp/vaalauras_crash.log (automatically cleaned up on normal exit, with prior crashes preserved in \u000baalauras_crash.prev.log).\n- **Layout & Sword Skill Icons**: Includes updated Edit Mode HUD layout positioning, side-aware center gap adjustments, and refreshed sword skill icons.\n\n### Smart Incremental Updates\nExisting v1.0.2 installations update automatically via the in-app delta updater (downloading only the updated compiled code archive and asset pack while reusing Python 3.12, GPU runtimes, and OCR models).\r\n",
